L0E0Q7kNvwGXIWZw&_nc_oc=AdrLX68PvnuGEU7vw4zjQnSpdLOlMKmLlxlzpesDcRY3Z0iopjobH48Fz4iYdDeCY6E&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQSiq5vrp9rnUiePrZAxQTD6QyC-X3zP-Zio4gZg8CjIwA&oe=6B0B1EDF"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "FailFactory_VideoCover.png", "id": "1947286778821967", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162717_1947286782155300_8392115553761755136_n.png?_nc_cat=111&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=rVfJ6gmJSEwQ7kNvwFE67A8&_nc_oc=Adr2QuTl2BuZm5JyBiU-u1JWr4LOOq5rD3qK9bKl6Tw-zwygkRsabPUv9efTGhrY8ac&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQTQh4xBY6KOZVN7ZOI9oAB8YLvsOMZQtd95bF5vDXUWrg&oe=6B0B3C2E"}, "display_name": "Fail Factory! Demo", "keywords": ["Puzzle", "Casual", "Arcade", "Physics", "Demo"], "long_description": "Immerse yourself in a whimsical robot factory while climbing your way up the corporate ladder from lowly intern to esteemed star employee. In a wacky spectacle of increasing chaos, strive to keep up with the escalating comedy of errors as you operate various assembly lines in a myriad of mini-games. Entrenched in a physics-based, no consequences playground, experience three main types of mini-game stations, all with the goal to help the factory build robots on a massive scale. \n \nWorking in assembly stations, sorting stations and quality assurance protocol (QAP), where you\u2019ll control unfathomably large robots, you\u2019ll hone your skills in a factory that feels reactive and alive, allowing for a fully immersive experience. Designed with approachability in mind, ridiculous failure is inevitable as you work your way to the top in this vibrant, witty and comedic stress-inducing Fail Factory!.", "short_description": "Immerse yourself in a whimsical robot factory while climbing your way up the corporate ladder from lowly intern to esteemed star employee. In a wacky spectacle of increasing chaos, strive to keep 